# Midnight Underpass: Midnight Arcade runs into Underpass, Claude & SZ's two synthwave
# originals as one track. The arcade winds down in E minor at 98 BPM, a snare roll under the
# breakdown ramps the tempo to 124 and a C7 pivots up a half step, and the underpass takes over
# in F minor: the heroic theme from half-time to four on the floor, and out on the fading pulse.
title: Midnight Underpass
composer: Claude & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
hidden: true
style: synthwave
key: E minor to F minor
tempo: 98
time: 4/4

